Synchronize the libelf/common source with the NetBSD-derived EmberBSD import.
Source: https://github.com/oxtech-ember/EmberBSD/tree/
c5d396f5698b68e956b29ee5b256bc7877e6c517/external/bsd/elftoolchain/dist
